licateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Meat Cart","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Meatmongers create magical carts to store their products. The cart is Large, weighs 15 bulk, has 80 hit points and a Hardness of 5 (Break Threshold 40), provides tools for butchering, and holds up to 50 bulk worth of meat stored in an extradimensional space inside the cart. Meat carried in the cart is subject to a 5th level <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.xRgU9rrhmGAgG4Rc]{Gentle Repose}</em>. As long as the meatmonger is pushing their cart, they gain a +10-foot status bonus to Speed and standard cover. A meatmonger needs two hands to push their cart. If a meatmonger's cart is destroyed, the stored meats pours out of the cart in a tidal wave of flesh. A meatmonger is able to make a new cart over 8 hours as long as it has appropriate materials. The cart loses its magic if the meatmonger that made it dies or abandons it.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-actors.Actor.DqOgEesrsExEG1fo]{Meat Cart}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.other-effects.I9lfZUiCwMiGogVi]{Effect: Cover}</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"meat-cart","toggleable":true,"value":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"land-speed","value":10,"type":"status","predicate":["meat-cart"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["extradimensional","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"fCmxSbJ8JPQDbQf0","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688873466668,"modifiedTime":1689210994698,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Placate","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>If a creature offers to buy 50gp worth of meat or provides 5 bulk worth of fresh meat and succeeds at a @Check[type:diplomacy|dc:23] check the meatmonger becomes friendly. While friendly, a meatmonger attempts to sell the creature more meat at a cost of 10gp per 1 Bulk of meat. 1 Bulk of purchased meat eaten within 10 minutes of purchase has the effects of Fine Cuts. Once a friendly meatmonger is no longer able to sell meat, they leave and becomes indifferent; they don't attempt to victimize their customer for more meat.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"z6mtVWVdF0gqle7E","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688873467829,"modifiedTime":1688873869610,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"name":"Meat Cart","type":"equipment","effects":[],"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":nul